cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "3D Data Materials: runnable code for 3D data science tutorials"
message: "If you use this code in work you publish, please cite it."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Self-contained Python implementations accompanying published tutorials on 3D
  point cloud processing, LiDAR, Gaussian splatting, meshing and spatial AI.
  One folder per article, each script readable top to bottom and runnable on a
  CPU against a named dataset.
authors:
